# Share app link after changes

After making any UI or app code changes, always end the response by:

1. Opening the app in the Cursor browser (`http://localhost:3001`, or the active local port if different)
2. Including the clickable link in the reply

Use Accountant features path when relevant: View as → Accountant → Contracts.
